{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1753315200, "end_date": 1754006399, "month_true_total": 126, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:04:05 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "201131468", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006624350", "personaname": "Otto", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ottoship/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1696, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1696, "last_played": 1753956760, "avatar": "9d5c66ce76fbd0fe950ec86e58c6d8b113ba9f2e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played all the Sniper Elite games and have seen a slow decline in the quality, this game not being one of the best!\nPersonal problems I found were too many restrictive terrain access's (not exactly open world!) \nOne minute not enough Germans the next they are crawling out of thin air when they've drawn you in to a terrain trap!\nToo many bullets required to put the enemy down (not realistic) and yet you can be dropped in seconds!\nAs a single player I wonder how you are supposed to unlock weaponry as I never seemed to get much more than the starting gear the entire game! All main story and DLCs completed.\nI would still recommend the game, for those who don't know better, but it's not the animal it was and I will think twice about buying another!", "timestamp_created": 1753957922, "timestamp_updated": 1753957922, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201080657", "author": {"steamid": "76561199258228234", "personaname": "ArberArber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199258228234/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 8468, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1123, "playtime_at_review": 3456, "last_played": 1791481937, "avatar": "3f49cad62b1b0a769a867c5dc58042d650499990"}, "language": "english", "review": "Greatest game ever!", "timestamp_created": 1753893758, "timestamp_updated": 1753893758, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201027924", "author": {"steamid": "76561198885293719", "personaname": "leonardlong12", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198885293719/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3215, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2793, "last_played": 1755297125, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good graphics,good response to keyboard input,fun to play.", "timestamp_created": 1753831678, "timestamp_updated": 1753831678, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200954251", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960344412", "personaname": "Nate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lighthousej/", "num_games_owned": 187, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1372, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 744, "last_played": 1780533717, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A lot like 5, which is pretty good.\n\nMaps are getting even smaller. SE 4 to me was top tier because you had a big rectangle of truly open world sniper spotting and shooting on your own. On SE 5, the maps got smaller, and with Resistance, you're playing on a small triangle or rectangle with one maybe pre-created sniper spots, then there's city fighting which means more CQB than I wanted in a sniper game.\n\nIt's still fun but I wouldn't recommend paying full price", "timestamp_created": 1753749898, "timestamp_updated": 1754137535, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200929487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020354397", "personaname": "SpookieRookie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020354397/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 6, "playtime_at_review": 217, "last_played": 1790530536, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sniper Elite, great as always!", "timestamp_created": 1753723299, "timestamp_updated": 1753723299, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200927988", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970581741", "personaname": "DwC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970581741/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1042, "last_played": 1770840031, "avatar": "bed03b5d6dceeb9d1d